      "side": 1,
      "message": "We discussed this with @jaszczyk@google.com recently in some other review. To our best knowledge, there is no particular reason to not allow an unaligned pvmfw address in the _guest_ memory. `gpa_range_overlaps_pvmfw()` doesn\u0027t rely on it being page-aligned.",
